{
 "documents": {
  "travel_policy.md": "# Travel policy\n\nEconomy class is required for all flights under six hours. Business class is allowed for flights of six hours or longer.\n\nThe daily meal allowance is 40 euros. Receipts are needed for every meal above 15 euros.\n\nHotels must cost less than 150 euros per night. Book hotels through the company travel portal.\n\nTravel must be approved by your manager before booking. Trips abroad also need approval from HR.\n"
 },
